WEBVTT

00:00:00,880 --> 00:00:14,780
Do you use the silver side up or the black side up on the grounding pad that came with the

00:00:14,780 --> 00:00:21,100
rife. That's a great question. You want to be putting the silver side against your skin,

00:00:21,660 --> 00:00:31,340
the black side away from you. If you look in your rife tutorial, there should be each of you

00:00:31,340 --> 00:00:37,100
should have received not only the binder that we sent you that has all of the basic rife

00:00:37,100 --> 00:00:43,580
information, but there should have been a little booklet depending upon the the generation of the

00:00:44,140 --> 00:00:49,900
of the rife machine that you have. It's either an F117 or an F122 and those are the two

00:00:49,900 --> 00:00:55,660
different types of generators that have currently been put out by true rife. When you open up

00:00:55,660 --> 00:01:01,820
that little pamphlet or booklet in there, it will give you some directions on how to utilize

00:01:01,900 --> 00:01:06,940
the grounding mat and they will be able to reiterate for you exactly the side to use it.

00:01:06,940 --> 00:01:11,740
So if you're going to be sitting on it and you want to put it as a chair underneath you,

00:01:11,740 --> 00:01:17,180
you just want to make sure that the black side is facing away from you and that you're sitting on the

00:01:17,180 --> 00:01:22,140
gray side. If you're going to be keeping it on the ground underneath your feet, you'd want to do the

00:01:22,140 --> 00:01:29,740
same thing black side away from you, set that set your feet on top of it.

